$###############################################################################
$#       Material card for Docol 1700M including J2 plasticity with            #
$#       isotropic work hardening and the GISSMO failure model.                #
$#                                                                             #
$#       Calibrated by Enodo - mail@enodo.no - www.enodo.no                    #
$#       July 29 2021                                                          #
$###############################                                               #
$#       mid 1760 Docol1700M  Gissmo                                           #
$#       0.5mm-2.1mm.                                                          #
$#       Leveled                                                               #
$#                                                                             #
$#       The Gissmo card is done according to the GM Worldwide engineering     #
$#       standard GMW14699 which means that all samples has been subjected     #
$#       to paint bake exposure at 170 degree Celcius for 20 minutes prior     #
$#       to testing                                                            #
$#                                                                             #
$#       SSAB strongly recommends LS-Dyna version 12 and onwards.              #
$#       Version 11 has no bending indication which can give a completely      #
$#       different result                                                      #
$#                                                                             #
$#       SSAB recommends element size 3-4mm                                    #
$#                                                                             #
$#       SSAB does not provide any warranty, representation or guarantees in   #
$#       connection with this material card whatsoever or any warranty that    #
$#       the data is correct, complete or error-free. SSAB recommends          #
$#       practical tests in order to validate the results.                     #
$#                                                                             #
$###############################                                               #
$#       Version 2  some change in the regularization curve                    #
$###############################                                               #
$#       Version 3                                                             #
$#       numfip 1.0 -> 2.0                                                     #
$#       lp2bi  0.0 -> 2.0                                                     #
$#       According to validation tests by SSAB                                 #
$###############################################################################
